      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Character Hint example (no image)\n\nPick traits on **Character Hint (Female)**. Its text goes to the prompter's `character_hint` input and is written into the H3 prompt word for word, after your draft. Fields left at `-` are not written.\n\n1. Pick a vision model on the **H3 Reference Prompter**.\n2. Change the draft or the hint.\n3. Run. The three Display Text nodes show the hint, the H3 prompt and the notes.\n\nTo use a character picture, connect a Load Image node to `image_1` and add `<Picture 1> is the character.` to the draft. Where the hint and the picture disagree, the hint wins.\n\nThis workflow draws no image. Send the `prompt` output to your MiniMax H3 Image workflow."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Character Hint example (no image)\n\nPick traits on **Character Hint (Female)**. Its text goes to the prompter's `character_hint` input and is written into the H3 prompt word for word, after your draft. Fields left at `-` are not written.\n\n1. Pick a vision model on the **H3 Reference Prompter**.\n2. Change the draft or the hint.\n3. Run. The three Display Text nodes show the hint, the H3 prompt and the notes.\n\nTo use a character picture, connect a Load Image node to `image_1` and add `<Picture 1> is the character.` to the draft. Where the hint and the picture disagree, the hint wins.\n\nThis workflow draws no image. Send the `prompt` output to your MiniMax H3 Image workflow."
      },
      "color": "#432",
